1 #SCRAMBLED                 (A32)
* Note: The following is a table of libraries which NOM needs as
*       step libraries. In an NSC environment, the customer must
*       specify them on the SYSNOM library definition. In a non-NSC
*       environment NOM automatically adds these and any specified
*       in the steplib parameters in SYSSATU. It avoids adding the same
*       library twice.
*       (SYSSAT is always added for NSC and non-NSC environments).
1 #USER-STEPLIB              (A8)
1 REQUIRED-LIBRARIES
  2 #SYSSAT                  (A8)      INIT <'SYSSAT'>
  2 #SYSSAT-ADDED            (L)       INIT <FALSE>
  2 #SYSNOMU                 (A8)      INIT <'SYSNOMU'>
  2 #SYSNOMU-ADDED           (L)       INIT <FALSE>
  2 #SYSNOMS                 (A8)      INIT <'SYSNOMS'>
  2 #SYSNOMS-ADDED           (L)       INIT <FALSE>
1 REDEFINE REQUIRED-LIBRARIES
  2 #LIB-TABLE               (3)
    3 #LIB-NAME              (A8)
    3 #LIB-ADDED             (L)
1 #ESY-NEW-VERSION           (A8)    INIT <'3.2'>
1 #NOM-SUBTASK-VERSION       (A3)
* #NOM-SUBTASK-VERSION is used internally for DDNAME only.
* There is no need to compare with other NOM versions.
